# Full local check set. CI runs a narrower critical subset via -checks on the
# command line (see scripts/lint_native.ps1), so this file stays permissive.
#
# Excluded checks are noisy on this Win32/COM/D3D codebase:
#   * raw pointer arithmetic / reinterpret_cast when walking packed audio
#     buffers, COM vtables, and GWLP_USERDATA-encoded HWND state;
#   * window styles are signed LONG_PTR by API definition, so bitwise ops trip
#     signed-bitwise on every GetWindowLongPtrW call;
#   * misc-include-cleaner misfires on the transitive MinGW/Windows headers
#     (DWORD, MARGINS, TRUE reported as "not directly included");
#   * k* named constants defeat avoid-magic-numbers; WS_EX_* fallback #define
#     defeats macro-usage;
#   * the public C-ABI enum in overlay_native.h must stay unscoped for ctypes;
#   * Overlay is a unique-ownership impl detail (mutex/thread/ComPtr members);
#   * set_geometry-style APIs trip easily-swappable-parameters on every call;
#   * scoped_lock/lock_guard are equivalent; braces/implicit-bool are LLVM
#     upstream's own style and would churn 50+ sites for no defect;
#   * misc-const-correctness is a rewrite engine, not a lint.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  modernize-*,
  misc-*,
  readability-braces-around-statements,
  readability-container-size-empty,
  readability-delete-null-pointer,
  readability-misleading-indentation,
  readability-redundant-control-flow,
  readability-simplify-boolean-expr,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-narrowing-conversions,
  -bugprone-signed-bitwise,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange,
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers,
  -cppcoreguidelines-macro-usage,
  -cppcoreguidelines-narrowing-conversions,
  -cppcoreguidelines-owning-memory,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-array-to-pointer-decay,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-reinterpret-cast,
  -cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-union-access,
  -cppcoreguidelines-special-member-functions,
  -cppcoreguidelines-use-enum-class,
  -misc-const-correctness,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -misc-non-private-member-variables-in-classes,
  -modernize-use-auto,
  -modernize-use-scoped-lock,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr,
  -portability-avoid-pragma-once,
  -readability-braces-around-statements,
  -readability-implicit-bool-conversion
